<title>USA: Int'l Tech Q3 net shr loss $0.10 vs $0.64.</title>
<headline>Int'l Tech Q3 net shr loss $0.10 vs $0.64.</headline>
<dateline>TORRANCE, Calif. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			    Quarter ended  Three quarters ended</p>
<p>		     Dec 27,	Dec 29,    Dec 27,	Dec 29,</p>
<p>			  1996	  1995	 1996	   1995</p>
<p> Revenues	  $92,513     $104,912   $266,419     $311,463</p>
<p>Net loss applicable</p>
<p>   to common stock (924)   (5,737)(f)   (13,455)   (3,137)(f)</p>
<p>Net loss per</p>
<p>common share (h)</p>
<p>			 (.10)	  (.64)     (1.48)	  (.35)</p>
<p>Average common and</p>
<p>common equivalent</p>
<p>shares outstanding</p>
<p>			 9,048	  9,011	9,100	  8,983</p>
<p>(f)  Includes net charge of $7,125 ($.79 per share) related to the recapitalization of Quanterra and adjustment of deferred tax asset valuation allowance.</p>
<p>(h)  Net loss per common share is computed by dividing net loss applicable to common stock by the weighted average number of common and common equivalent shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
